<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Souza Cruz Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Souza Cruz Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian tobacco company Souza Cruz issued the following statement on its first quarter consolidated results.</p>
<p>			Q1 1997	     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	  65.3 million	    33.0 million</p>
<p>    Oper profit	 56.7 million	    21.3 million</p>
<p>    Net revs	   413.3 million	   403.6 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Rio de Janeiro newsroom 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
